WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.788
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.649 --> 00:00:03.970
<v><b>M1:</b></v> I’ll soon’ve been living here for twenty years.

00:00:06.685 --> 00:00:07.406
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.237 --> 00:00:11.735
<v><b>F1:</b></v> If we’d set off earlier, we wouldn’t’ve got caught in the rush hour.

00:00:14.577 --> 00:00:15.371
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.051 --> 00:00:18.294
<v><b>F2:</b></v> They should’ve known that it’d be a disaster.

00:00:21.027 --> 00:00:21.796
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:26.548
<v><b>M2:</b></v> It´ll be easier to choose the right place if you’ve already researched online.

00:00:29.457 --> 00:00:30.259
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.373
<v><b>M3:</b></v> If I were you, I’d accept their offer.

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:37.224
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:38.145 --> 00:00:39.901
<v><b>F3:</b></v> You shouldn’t’ve left so late.